account credits Manaswini Sahoo; ripe-fruit cake distinct from unresolved tala khaja and separately documented germinated-seed Talagaja.','Enduri:9paragraph authored leaf/process/occasion story; Lipi Das compilation and Namita Sarangi account preserve source-specific household/season limits.','Poda pitha:8paragraph authored regional methods/season story; named Sujata Dehury/Sweta Biswal accounts not all-household rules.'],'authorship':'Collection JSON has no author field. Shared template displays Founder & Editor-in-Chief: Ahimanikya Satapathy in credits, not a conventional article By line. Preserve named external cooks/writers and all existing actual credits; do not invent fieldwork.','images':'Five CC BY-SA4.0 photographic records retained with creator/source/license/changes/alt and exact current image hashes. Hero repeats badi image. Metadata match is not a fresh legal or visual approval.','links':['/food/ou-khatta/','/food/badi-chura/','/food/tala-pitha/','/food/enduri-pitha/','/food/poda-pitha/','/food/fire-cooking/','/food/','/contribute/','/journey/'],'source_roles':'Collection credits display photo sources; narrative evidence is in linked dish pages and saved reading source union. Do not mistake no inline numbered references on this hub for absent evidence in its children.'},'presentation_followup':'Shared legacy disclosure says Human editorial and Odia review pending, with credits in details; record as existing state. Any standards-alignment change must be separately scoped and must not automatically reclassify every FoodStoryCollection consumer. No change proposed in this readiness task.','actual_checks':['Read handoff, current queue111, governance/editorial standard and relevant research-map pointers.','Ran existingKB query everyday:290records/3tasks; retained query output, no absence inference.','Read actual collection config/template/edition logic and all41 narrative paragraphs across the five linked dish records; source register11 entries inspected.','